{
  "name": "@styloviz/scroll-area",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": "A styled scrollbar drawn over a genuinely scrolling element — never in place of one. Minimum grabbable thumb with the track arithmetic corrected for it, click-to-page on the track, and edge fades that are the only affordance a hidden scrollbar leaves.",
